[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、今日は部活来れる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you two free for club activities today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、もちろん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, of course!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたんですか？\u3000改まって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's with the sudden formality?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、そろそろ文化祭でしょ？\n錬金術部の出し物決める会議やるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, the cultural festival is coming up soon, right? We need to have a meeting to decide what our Alchemy Club is going to do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "文化祭！\u3000なんという青春の響き……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The cultural festival! Ah, the sweet sound of youth!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この学園の文化祭って結構力入れてるって聞きました。\n学外のお偉いさんも視察に来るとか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've heard this academy's cultural festival is quite a big deal. Even important officials from outside come to observe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう！\u3000うちの部も本気でやるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! Our club's going all out too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人も出し物のアイデア、考えといて！\nそれから今日は絶対遅刻しないよーに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two should think of some ideas for our exhibit! And please make sure you're not late today!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知いたしました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出し物か……何がいいかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What kind of exhibit should we put on, I wonder?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "文化祭かあ……うちの学校はあんまり\nそういう行事に熱心じゃないから、なんか新鮮だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A cultural festival, huh... My school wasn't really big on events like that, so this feels kinda fresh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一応、留学生も希望すれば\n参加できるみたいですけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exchange students can participate too if they want to, from what I've heard..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んー……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、せっかくだし私たちもなんかやってみる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, since we're here, why don't we participate in it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000やりましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a great idea! Let's do it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、結構ノリノリだねえ。\nまずは何やるか決めなきゃだけど……ん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, you're pretty fired up about it, aren't you? First, we'll need to come up with a plan... Oh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうかしたんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is something wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、ユナさん……だよねえ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that... Juna over there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！？\u3000だ、大丈夫ですかー！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Are you alright?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょちょ、ちょっと！\u3000どしたの！？\u3000体調悪い？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, hey! What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……大丈夫だ。少々寝不足でな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... I'm fine. I've just been a little sleep-deprived."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あまり無理しちゃダメですよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You really shouldn't push yourself so hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "夜更かしでもしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Were you up late or something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。文化祭の準備でな……\n少々手こずってしまい、夜遅くまで作業してしまった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I was preparing for the cultural festival until I ran into some difficulties and ended up working until late at night."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、なんの出し物をやるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? What kind of exhibit are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや……実は、私は文化祭の実行委員なんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually... I'm on the organizing committee."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]